                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is a good CVR for a D2C brand?</h3>
                                        <p>Category-dependent. Fashion 1.5-4%, beauty 2-5%, jewelry 1.5-3%. Compare to your category, not general averages.</p>
                                        <h3>Which CRO test drives the biggest lift?</h3>
                                        <p>Page speed and mobile checkout simplification typically drive largest lifts. Boring, huge ROI.</p>
                                        <h3>How many CRO tests should I run per month?</h3>
                                        <p>2-4 tests/month for growth-stage. Fewer if traffic is limited (each test needs adequate sample size).</p>
                                        <h3>Is Google Optimize replaceable?</h3>
